{
  "name": "Furrykin (Felid): Predator Patience",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "art/bbttcc/GOTTGAIT/BBTTCC%20Button%20Icons/BBTTCC_button_icon_bite_animal_3.png",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Normalized Ancestry Feat.</strong> Formerly granted automatically by <em>Furrykin (Felid)</em> at level 11; now available as an optional ancestry feat.</p><p><em>“You can wait out a problem until it becomes a mistake.”</em></p>\n        <p><strong>Predator Patience.</strong> You have advantage on Perception and Insight checks while hidden or observing quietly. Once per long rest, you may treat a failed attack roll as a hit (describe the perfect timing).</p><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"predatorPatience\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #c08e6a;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(95,65,45,0.18);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#e8b890;margin-bottom:0.25rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Predator Patience</strong></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.86rem;opacity:0.92;line-height:1.4\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/long rest &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Action:</strong> Free (on failed attack roll) &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;margin-top:0.3rem\">Treat a failed attack roll as a hit. Describe the perfect timing.</div>\n</div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
